Spoilers follow


Unicorn horns are useful for many things, and many people (myself
included) feel that it is absulutly essential for life.

Unicorn horns can be used as weapons, and will never rust.
When applying a unicorn horn, you will loose an annoying condtion (ie:
confused, hallucinating, stuned, blind, etc...)  Please note however
that applying a cursed unicorn horn will give you one, and applying
a blessed unicorn horn will cure you of them all (I think).
Unicorn horns will also change harmful potions (confsioun, poison,
hallucination, etc...) to water if you dip it in.

A worm's tooth (from the novel dune) can be changed to a crysknife
if you are weilding it and enchant it.  Paticulary nice if you add
a touch of poison to it (I think you can, or atleast you could at
one time).  They make excelent daggers.

Note about crysknives: in the book, if a crysknife was left away
form a human body for too long it degraded, and it is considered
ultimate descrication to sheate a crysknife unblooded.

I don't think that the above is in the game (never cared to test
it), however if it isn't the mystical dev team might implement them.

